  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15.25 ounce) package lemon cake mix",
    "1.3332999944687 cups vegetable oil",
    "0.75 cup orange juice",
    "4 large eggs",
    "1 (3 ounce) package lime flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "4 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "3 tablespoons fresh lime juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease three 8-inch round cake pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C6rSFztHUPdoknnx9TliO4jl-Os=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8310-key-lime-cake-iii-VAT-step-01-bb4fda646cec4e5a85b66e8fa061d874.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8310/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cake: Beat cake mix, oil, orange juice, eggs, and gelatin mix in a large bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Yc7NWDYkTK_t40AcSGBIOk33-TY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8310-key-lime-cake-iii-VAT-step-02-3aab435980fa40009554630f0a165272.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8310/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the prepared cake pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KkgCEnvWzFm90GuRTstuJ7wVi_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8310-key-lime-cake-iii-VAT-step-03-4b33486f390c46cba79f6d76cfb3bcde.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8310/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of a cake layer comes out clean, 16 to 18 minutes. Allow cake layers to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7wMakJNjbGl55EXQsNKOjgg_lTA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8310-key-lime-cake-iii-VAT-step-04-bf4550e768df4f989104943057b8571b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8310/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make frosting: Beat cream cheese and butter in a large bowl until light and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zq7ZvFkS0DHDcZtRj0TkoJDJdO0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8310-key-lime-cake-iii-VAT-step-05-8ec082a3d5c94917aaaafa27c1b9aa78.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8310/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add confectioners' sugar and lime juice; mix until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
